Ah, mike, caught us
in the middle
of our daily routine.

2227
01:30:10,472 --> 01:30:12,408
What's that they say
about boxing, frank?

2228
01:30:12,442 --> 01:30:13,708
It's the only real sport.

2229
01:30:13,742 --> 01:30:15,077
It's the only honest sport.

2230
01:30:15,110 --> 01:30:16,645
It's the sport of men.

2231
01:30:16,678 --> 01:30:17,813
Absolutely right.

2232
01:30:17,847 --> 01:30:19,315
Grab yourself a beer

2233
01:30:19,348 --> 01:30:21,783
and grab me one, too,
fellow fighter.

2234
01:30:21,817 --> 01:30:23,218
Okay, because we're men.

2235
01:30:23,252 --> 01:30:24,820
We are men!

2236
01:30:24,853 --> 01:30:26,122
Yes, you've made your point,
frank.

2237
01:30:26,155 --> 01:30:27,357
- We're men!
- Yes, frank.

2238
01:30:27,390 --> 01:30:29,158
Oh!

2239
01:30:29,192 --> 01:30:31,760
You want a piece of me?
Come on, come on.
Huh?

2240
01:30:37,867 --> 01:30:39,202
Oh, oh, frank.

2241
01:30:39,235 --> 01:30:40,770
Frank, please.

2242
01:30:40,803 --> 01:30:42,070
Please, enough.

2243
01:30:42,103 --> 01:30:45,273
I have to get the button.

2244
01:30:47,008 --> 01:30:48,343
[Chuckling]

2245
01:31:57,780 --> 01:32:00,082
All right, men,
into the woods.

2246
01:32:04,920 --> 01:32:08,323
This has been a presentation
from comedy central.

